  "question": {
    "text": "A work of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>146</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math> is performed on the gas, in order to compress one kilomole of gas adiabatically and in this process the temperature of the gas increases by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. The gas is ( <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> )",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "GpzeI",
      "text": "monoatomic",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
