      "text": "a mixture of monoatomic and diatomic",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>According to first law of thermodynamics<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>Q</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>U</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>W</mtext></math><br /><br />For an adiabatic process, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>Q=0</mtext></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>U</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>W</mtext></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>U</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>W</mtext></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mtext>V</mtext></msub><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>T</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>W</mtext></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mtext>V</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>W</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#916;</mo><mtext>T</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mtext>146</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mtext>10</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mtext>10</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />For diatomic gas,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mtext>V</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext>R</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mtext>8.3&#160;=&#160;20.8&#160;J&#160;mol</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mtext>&#160;K</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Hence the gas is diatomic.</p>",
